# Trivy ignore list — vulnerabilities accepted with justification.
# Format: one CVE/GHSA id per line, optional comment.
# Trivy reads this file from the working directory (repo root in our CI).
# Reviewed periodically when bumping container deps.

# (2026-10-28) All litellm entries removed: litellm entered the images only
# through openviking in mira-mcp, which was never used (RETRIEVAL_BACKEND=openwebui
# in prd; viking_store.py falls back to sqlite). Dropping openviking removes
# litellm from every scanned image. See #4865.
